│                        ││  7 in this view.                             ││                                                                                    │
│                        ││                                              ││     • The dump goes stale when fpath changes. Installing a new completion won't    │
│                        ││                                              ││     show up until the file is rebuilt, which is the sort of bug that is very hard  │
│                        ││                                              ││     to spot a month from now.                                                      │
│                        ││                                              ││     • Two shells starting at once can both decide to rebuild it. Writing to a      │
│                        ││                                              ││     temporary file and renaming it keeps a half-written dump from ever being read. │
│                        ││                                              ││     • compinit -C skips the security check on the files it finds, so a             │
│                        ││                                              ││     world-writable directory on fpath would go unnoticed. Is that a trade you want │
│                        ││                                              ││     to make on every machine this file lands on?                                   │
│                        ││                                              ││                                                                                    │
│                        ││                                              ││     One way to cover the first two:                                                │
│                        ││                                              ││                                                                                    │
│                        ││                                              ││     if [[ -n ${ZDOTDIR:-$HOME}/.zcompdump(#qN.mh+24) ]]; then                      │
│                        ││                                              ││     compinit -d "$tmp" && mv "$tmp" "${ZDOTDIR:-$HOME}/.zcompdump"                 │
│                        ││                                              ││     else                                                                           │
│                        ││                                              ││     compinit -C                                                                    │
│                        ││                                              ││     fi                                                                             │
